{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02388",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.84,
      "end_seconds": 3.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.37,
      "end_seconds": 9.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.96,
      "end_seconds": 26.21,
      "duration_seconds": 15.25,
      "text": "Um, I wanted to get a swollen cheek looked at. I took the morning off to come in today. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.57,
      "end_seconds": 29.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.7,
      "end_seconds": 44.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.63,
      "end_seconds": 68.28,
      "duration_seconds": 13.65,
      "text": "Okay: weight 95 kilos, temperature is 38.9 degrees, BMI works out to 28.4, BP is 115 over 69, heart rate 98, SpO2 95 percent on room air, height 183 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.76,
      "end_seconds": 85.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.64,
      "end_seconds": 90.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "About... well, about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.02,
      "end_seconds": 94.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "So, does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.61,
      "end_seconds": 114.73,
      "duration_seconds": 19.12,
      "text": "Yeah, when it starts I tend to get a throbbing toothache as well. There's a bad taste as well. With throbbing toothache, about a six out of ten. Yes, hot drinks. That makes it worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.03,
      "end_seconds": 121.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "Did you get difficulty swallowing, noisy breathing or difficulty opening the mouth?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.42,
      "end_seconds": 131.93,
      "duration_seconds": 9.51,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, no difficulty swallowing, noisy breathing or difficulty opening the mouth, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.36,
      "end_seconds": 136.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "So, and eye swelling, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.88,
      "end_seconds": 140.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any eye swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.88,
      "end_seconds": 147.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.95,
      "end_seconds": 150.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Nothing odd there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.34,
      "end_seconds": 154.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "How are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.09,
      "end_seconds": 157.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.16,
      "end_seconds": 163.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.86,
      "end_seconds": 165.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.95,
      "end_seconds": 170.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Right, any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.34,
      "end_seconds": 177.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "Yeah, um, no, I've always been fairly healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.81,
      "end_seconds": 190.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.54,
      "end_seconds": 192.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "No, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.15,
      "end_seconds": 197.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.15,
      "end_seconds": 204.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "Sorry, you know, what was I saying, my son has asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.7,
      "end_seconds": 207.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.98,
      "end_seconds": 211.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.4,
      "end_seconds": 216.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.58,
      "end_seconds": 221.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.61,
      "end_seconds": 226.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.78,
      "end_seconds": 233.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.49,
      "end_seconds": 252.34,
      "duration_seconds": 6.85,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.09,
      "end_seconds": 257.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "I'm on paracetamol, 1 gram, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.28,
      "end_seconds": 263.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.82,
      "end_seconds": 264.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.9,
      "end_seconds": 268.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "So, raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.32,
      "end_seconds": 291.48,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "text": "The lower right molar is tender with swollen gum and the cheek is puffy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.58,
      "end_seconds": 305.6,
      "duration_seconds": 12.02,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. Taking everything into account, I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be a dental abscess, or it might be a salivary gland infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.52,
      "end_seconds": 310.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.96,
      "end_seconds": 323.3,
      "duration_seconds": 12.34,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a dental abscess is my leading thought, not anything worse. A dental X-ray is what I'd like next, for dental abscess."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.39,
      "end_seconds": 327.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Okay, I'll do it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.82,
      "end_seconds": 360.35,
      "duration_seconds": 31.53,
      "text": "What I'm giving you is amoxicillin, 500 milligrams, three times a day, five days. That's for dental abscess. See the dentist today, rinse with warm salt water. I'd like you to see the dentist as well, and I'll write the referral. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency. I'll want another look in two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 362.32,
      "end_seconds": 363.02,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.77,
      "end_seconds": 369.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "So, anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.36,
      "end_seconds": 372.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}